---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {path} from '../site';import {NEWS_TOPICS} from '../lib/news-topics.mjs';
---
<Base title="搜索 · 海波东" noindex><h1 class="sr-only">全站搜索</h1><div id="site-search" data-index={path('search-index.json')}>
<form class="search-form" role="search"><label class="sr-only" for="query">搜索站内内容</label><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 4 4"/></svg><input id="query" type="search" placeholder="搜索博客、资讯、作品…" autocomplete="off"/><button type="submit">搜索</button></form>
<div class="search-scope" role="group" aria-label="搜索范围">{[['all','全部'],['post','博客'],['news','资讯'],['work','作品']].map(([value,label])=><button type="button" data-search-kind={value} aria-pressed={value==='all'}>{label}<small data-count={value}></small></button>)}</div>
<div class="search-filters" id="news-filters" hidden><label>来源语言 <select id="content-language"><option value="all">全部语言</option><option value="zh">中文来源</option><option value="en">英文来源</option></select></label><label>分类 <select id="content-category">{NEWS_TOPICS.map(t=><option value={t}>{t}</option>)}</select></label></div>
<div class="search-summary"><p id="search-status" role="status">正在加载索引…</p><button id="clear-filters" type="button" hidden>清除筛选</button></div>
<div id="search-start" class="search-start" hidden><p>搜标题、正文或来源，找到站内已经收录的内容。</p><div class="search-suggestions"><span>试试</span>{['AI 工程','OpenAI','交互','mind'].map(q=><button type="button" data-search-suggestion={q}>{q}</button>)}</div></div>
<button id="retry-index" class="quiet-button" hidden>重新加载</button><section id="results" class="search-list" aria-label="搜索结果"></section><nav id="result-pages" class="result-footer" aria-label="搜索结果分页" hidden><button id="previous-page">上一页</button><span id="page-label"></span><button id="next-page">下一页</button></nav>
</div><noscript><p>搜索需要 JavaScript。也可以浏览<a href={path('archive/')}>博客</a>和<a href={path('news/')}>资讯</a>。</p></noscript></Base>
<script>import '../scripts/search';</script>
